{"id":"vod_sn_38699","vodId":"38699","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法战争","name_cn":"魔法战争","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9db08ea9623d0f59259599dd3b5e5ad1.jpg"},"summary":"七濑武（宫野真守 配音）是一名看似十分淡漠，内心里也却是冷若冰霜的少年。曾经不堪回首的往事让他选择封闭自己的内心，不透露出丝毫的感情。虽然一直克制着自己的情绪，但七濑武又时时能够感受到内心里还在燃烧的火焰。一次偶然中，七濑武在校园里遇见了一名昏倒在地上的少女，善良的七濑武将少女带到了保健室，得知她名叫相羽六（东山奈央 配音）。　　让七濑武没有想到的是，他和相羽六的相遇彻底改变了自己的人生轨迹。相羽六在误打误撞之中将七濑武变为了魔法使。之后，七濑武的青梅竹马五十岛胡桃（濑户麻沙美 配音）、同班同学伊田一三（铃村健一 配音）和保健老师兵头七海等人纷纷拥有了能够使用魔法阵的能力。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/qyJkEcwuXC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/LT6P40SNqV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/pHRy1T6eph1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/XJVBUJKumf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/f2U8EhNbvn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/fRNJatgHR71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/GwNp12r7uE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/rgXrXtykBT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/FtkZXKx1av1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/sT70sDynQV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/bFmwgL9A0W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/jsrB6KHYAu1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:55.652Z"}